# Permanent SSH public keys for rekall benchmark instances.
#
# Every instance launched via `rekall infra up` will have these keys
# installed in /home/ubuntu/.ssh/authorized_keys at boot, in addition
# to the launcher's own ssh_key (from .local.toml).
#
# Adding a key here grants permanent SSH access to all future rekall
# instances under any team member's launch. Only add keys you trust.
#
# Format: one OpenSSH public key per line. Blank lines and `#` comments
# are ignored. Each key should have a trailing comment (email or name)
# for attribution.
#
# Example:
#   ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAI...example erik@tigerdata.com
#   ssh-rsa     AAAAB3NzaC1yc2EAAAADAQAB...example joe@example.com

